Strategic Analysis of KONDA:
The KONDA system is best categorized as a Level 1: The Connected Problem-Solver or potentially a Level 2: The Strategic Problem-Solver (based on the taxonomy in the whitepaper).
Level 1 Alignment: It connects the LLM (Gemini 2.5) to a set of specialized tools (TicketVisionTool, SevaBookingTool) to execute a multi-step task (booking, analysis, payment).
Addressing the Problem: The inclusion of the CrowdAnalyticsTool and Alert Tool is particularly smart. This moves beyond simple booking automation and addresses the stated problems of "server management issue" and "crowd booking" by integrating real-time observational data and operational control.


